<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<odoo>
    <record id="view_department_form_wh_flow" model="ir.ui.view">
        <field name="name">cst.production.department.form.wh.flow</field>
        <field name="model">cst.production.department</field>
        <field name="inherit_id" ref="cst_kerama_shift.view_department_form"/>
        <field name="arch" type="xml">
            <xpath expr="//page[@name='lines']" position="before">
                <page string="Omborlar" name="warehouses">
                    <group>
                        <group string="Bo'lim ombori">
                            <field name="warehouse_id" options="{'no_create': True}"/>
                            <field name="supply_warehouse_ids" widget="many2many_tags" options="{'no_create': True}"/>
                            <field name="cst_auto_supply"/>
                        </group>
                        <group string="Tayyor mahsulot">
                            <field name="output_warehouse_id" options="{'no_create': True}"/>
                            <field name="cst_auto_forward"/>
                        </group>
                    </group>
                    <div class="text-muted">
                        Buyurtma «Ishlaydigan ombor»da ochiladi: xomashyo shu ombordan olinadi, natija shu
                        omborga tushadi. Yetmagan xomashyo «Xomashyo omborlari»dan ichki ko'chirish bilan so'raladi.
                        1-sort va 2-sort natija «Tayyor mahsulot ketadigan ombor»ga ko'chiriladi; uni o'sha omborning
                        qabul qiluvchisi tasdiqlaydi. Yangi ombor ochsangiz, shu ro'yxatlarda o'zi chiqadi.
                    </div>
                </page>
            </xpath>
        </field>
    </record>

    <record id="view_department_list_wh_flow" model="ir.ui.view">
        <field name="name">cst.production.department.list.wh.flow</field>
        <field name="model">cst.production.department</field>
        <field name="inherit_id" ref="cst_kerama_shift.view_department_list"/>
        <field name="arch" type="xml">
            <xpath expr="//field[@name='output_kind']" position="after">
                <field name="warehouse_id" optional="show"/>
                <field name="output_warehouse_id" optional="show"/>
            </xpath>
        </field>
    </record>
</odoo>
